,{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transientStatuses","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"TransientStatus","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations15TransientStatusV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"url":"\/documentation\/aptabaseencoding\/aptabasebatchencoder\/transientstatuses","type":"topic","title":"transientStatuses","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The status Aptabase answers that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" retries, beside 408, 429 and every 5xx:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"418, which Aptabase answers when a request’s body arrives slower than 60 bytes a second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after a 10-second grace period, as over a poor connection."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}